          "filename": "Approaching Capel Horeb from the south - geograph.org.uk - 944760.jpg",
          "caption": "Approaching Capel Horeb from the south. The early history of the Independents in the district was quite eventful. Twice in 1743 the vicar of Llanffinan SH4975 led a gang of some fifty local ruffians to beat up the Penmynydd Independent congregation. \n943060",
